        "content": "📊 New Forrester Total Economic Impact™ study for Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central\nA newly published Forrester TEI study highlights the potential value organizations can realize by modernizing finance and operations on a unified ERP platform.\n\nThe study projects that the composite organization could achieve:\n➡️ More than 200% ROI and $460K net present value (NPV) over three years\n➡️ Potential payback in six months (within a three‑year modeled analysis)\n\nBy year three, the study also points to projected operational improvements, including:\n➡️ Up to 30% reduction in monthly close time\n➡️ Up to 50% time savings across AP, AR, and billing activities\n\nFrom improving finance productivity to reducing complexity and gaining real‑time visibility, Dynamics 365 Business Central helps organizations operate more efficiently and make better‑informed decisions.\nJust as importantly, it creates a strong foundation for what comes next with Copilot and AI‑powered agents.\n\n👉 Read Mike Morton’s blog for the full findings: https://lnkd.in/egY29JdA",
