      "shareLinkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7429790298580525056",
      "shareUrn": "urn:li:ugcPost:7429790298580525056",
      "content": "⚽ New Signing Alert ⚽ \n\nWe're pleased to share that Jake Hill has joined our growing team at Quick Dynamics as our new Business Central Support Consultant.\n\nJake is an Arsenal fan, but we’ve welcomed him anyway. Every team needs a bit of balance and apparently that includes bringing in someone who thinks the North London derby counts as a stressful day out.\n\nHe was offered the job the day after Arsenal walloped Pompey 4-1 and was gracious enough not to mention it at all. \n\nHe’s already settled in brilliantly, bringing enthusiasm, sharp thinking and the sort of calm focus that makes the rest of us wonder if he’s secretly been here for months. We're genuinely excited to have him here with us.\n\nPlease join us in giving Jake a warm welcome. Even if you support Spurs.",
